REE updates.\n\nBe sure to join thousands of seekers in the Paranoia Discord for info on updates, challenges, giveaways, and sneak peeks! discord.gg/44TPsXNYxB", "short_description": "Paranoia is an upcoming psychological survival horror game for single-player and multiplayer with replayability in mind. It is set in an original universe inspired by the Backrooms. Enter the deepest trenches of an alternate universe with entities where nothing is safe. With over 10 levels to explore, on release, over 3 game modes, leaderboards, cosmetics, and much more! More content like additional levels, cosmetics, etc, will be added in later FREE updates.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.paranoiavr.com/paranoia-vr-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Natix Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.paranoiavr.com/paranoia-vr-privacy-policy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8883354031780671"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2126262441599771"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2126262441599771"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1777392000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2126262441599771"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_